Description: Summarises consensus and agreement across precomputed molecular
    docking prioritizations. It calculates within-method ranks, rank coverage,
    mean ranks, Borda scores, and pairwise rank agreement without combining
    raw score scales. It does not run docking engines or infer molecular
    binding, biological activity, efficacy, or safety.
